---
import profilePic from "../assets/profile.png";
---

<section class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 mt-8 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center md:items-start gap-4">
  <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-5 w-full md:w-1/3 group text-center">
    <img
      src={profilePic.src}
      alt="Profile photo"
      class="w-52 h-52 sm:w-56 sm:h-56 rounded-full object-cover shadow-md ring-2 ring-[#c4b5fd] transform transition duration-300 group-hover:scale-105 group-hover:ring-theme-accent group-hover:shadow-lg"
    />

    <div class="flex gap-5 text-theme-textDark dark:text-theme-textLight text-2xl justify-center">
      <a href="https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=NZFX5LIAAAAJ&hl=en&oi=ao" target="_blank" aria-label="Google Scholar" class="hover:text-theme-accent hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-200">
        <i class="fas fa-graduation-cap"></i>
      </a>
      <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/afrin-dange/" target="_blank" aria-label="LinkedIn" class="hover:text-theme-accent hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-200">
        <i class="fab fa-linkedin"></i>
      </a>
      <a href="https://github.com/AfrinDange/" target="_blank" aria-label="GitHub" class="hover:text-theme-accent hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-200">
        <i class="fab fa-github"></i>
      </a>
      <a href="https://x.com/afrin_dange/" target="_blank" aria-label="Twitter" class="hover:text-theme-accent hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-200">
        <i class="fab fa-x-twitter"></i>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="flex-1 opacity-0 animate-fade-in animation-delay-150">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-heading font-bold mb-2">Hi, I'm Afrin 👋</h1>  
    
    <p class="mb-3 text-lg text-justify">
      I recently completed my MS by Research at 
      <a href="https://www.minds.iitb.ac.in/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-theme-accent underline underline-offset-2">CMInDS, IIT Bombay</a>, 
      where I had the privilege of working with 
      <a href="https://www.cse.iitb.ac.in/~sunita/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-theme-accent underline underline-offset-2">Prof. Sunita Sarawagi</a> 
      on in-context learning, and the design and adaptation of foundation models for time series. Our work on instance-level adaptation for forecasting with covariates has been accepted at CIKM 2025. I was also fortunate to collaborate with 
      <a href="https://praneethnetrapalli.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-theme-accent underline underline-offset-2">Dr. Praneeth Netrapalli</a>, where our joint work on in-context learning was presented at the ICML 2024 TF2M Workshop.
    </p>

    <p class="mb-3 text-lg text-justify">
      I'm currently seeking research opportunities as a Research Assistant or Intern to explore new directions. I'm especially interested in improving architecture designs, adaptation techniques for improving generalization and reliability under uncertainty, and reasoning. I would also like to explore post-training and alignment. If you're hiring, I'd love to hear from you 🙂 
    </p>
  </div>

</section>
